From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:15:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 32/40] Add column (block) selection like Notepad++

Alt+drag or Alt+Shift+arrows select the same visual columns on every
line between two points (a tab reaches the next tab stop, lines ending
left of the block are skipped, wrapped lines use their logical line).
Typing, Backspace and Delete act on every line, copy joins the lines
with newlines, and pasting a copied block or as many lines as the block
has goes in line by line; each edit is one undo step. A plain click or
navigation key leaves block mode. Not available with vi bindings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

